# False

Logical False (Kite). Selects the second option. I matches Identity I but usually represented as `x => y => y` which is `KI`.

## Wave Function

@[ts]
```typescript
export const False = <A, B>(x: A) => (y: B): B => y;
```

@[rs]
```rust
pub fn False<A, B>(_x: A, y: B) -> B { y }
```
